---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { seo, site } from '../data/site';
---
<PageLayout
  title={seo.terms.title}
  description={seo.terms.description}
  heading={seo.terms.h1}
  path="/terms"
>
  <h2>Content production projects</h2>
  <p>
    Prices shown on this site are starting rates for the scope described in each package.
    Final pricing depends on location, travel, deliverable volume, usage requirements, and
    production needs, and is confirmed in writing before a project begins. Any estimate
    produced by the project builder is an estimate only and is not a quote or an offer.
  </p>
  <p>
    Usage, licensing, exclusivity, and posting terms apply per video unless a written package
    or campaign agreement states otherwise, and must be agreed before the shoot. Retroactive
    paid usage licensing is not available.
  </p>

  <h2>Travel plans</h2>
  <p>
    Travel plans sold on this site are custom digital products prepared individually for each
    customer based on the details provided in the intake form. Delivery timelines shown on
    each plan begin once your completed intake form is received. Plans are delivered by email.
  </p>
  <p>
    Travel plans are recommendations based on personal experience and research. You are
    responsible for verifying visa requirements, travel advisories, opening hours, and prices
    before and during your trip, and for your own travel decisions, bookings, and safety. We
    are not a travel agency and do not make bookings on your behalf unless explicitly stated
    in your plan.
  </p>

  <h2>Licence and ownership</h2>
  <p>
    Plans are licensed for your personal use. Please do not resell or redistribute them. All
    site content is &copy; Malachi Marshall-Harris.
  </p>

  <p>
    Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
